/* Settings · LAN access */
"LAN access" = "局域网访问";
"Allow LAN devices" = "允许局域网设备连接";
"Other devices on the same network can use this Mac as their HTTP proxy." = "同一局域网内的其它设备可以把这台 Mac 当作 HTTP 代理使用。";
"Certificate URL" = "证书地址";
"Open certificate URL" = "在浏览器中打开";
"On iOS: download the profile, then Settings → General → VPN & Device Management → install it and enable it in Certificate Trust Settings. On Android: install it as a trusted CA." = "iOS：下载描述文件后，前往「设置 → 通用 → VPN 与设备管理」安装，并在「证书信任设置」中启用。Android：将其安装为受信任的 CA 证书。";
