"Scan with the device camera to download and install the root certificate." = "用设备相机扫码即可下载并安装根证书。";

/* LAN certificate */
"iOS certificate profile" = "iOS 证书描述文件";
"Android / other certificate" = "Android / 其它设备证书";
"On iOS: open the profile and install it under Settings → General → VPN & Device Management, then enable it in Certificate Trust Settings. On Android: download the .cer file and install it as a trusted CA." = "iOS：打开描述文件后，在「设置 → 通用 → VPN 与设备管理」中安装，再到「证书信任设置」启用完全信任。Android：下载 .cer 文件后安装为受信任的 CA 证书。";
"Scan with the device camera to open the iOS certificate profile and install it." = "用设备相机扫码打开证书描述文件并安装。";

/* LAN certificate */
"Android / HarmonyOS certificate" = "Android / 鸿蒙证书";
"On iOS: open the profile and install it under Settings → General → VPN & Device Management, then enable it in Certificate Trust Settings. On Android / HarmonyOS: download the .cer file, then install it as a trusted CA (HarmonyOS: Settings → Privacy & security → More security settings → Encryption and credentials → Install a certificate → CA certificate)." = "iOS：打开描述文件后到「设置 → 通用 → VPN 与设备管理」安装，并在「证书信任设置」中启用。Android / 鸿蒙：下载 .cer 文件后安装为受信任的 CA 证书（鸿蒙：设置 → 隐私和安全 → 更多安全设置 → 加密和凭据 → 安装数字证书 → CA 证书）。";
"Scan to download the certificate (Android / HarmonyOS); on iOS use the profile link above instead." = "扫码下载证书（Android / 鸿蒙）；iOS 请使用上方的描述文件链接。";

/* Certificate page */
"Open or scan this address on the device: iPhone/iPad get an installable profile, Android/HarmonyOS download the certificate. Then trust the root certificate in the system settings." = "在设备上打开或扫码此地址即可：iPhone/iPad 会下载可安装的描述文件，Android / 鸿蒙会下载证书；安装后请在系统设置中信任根证书。";
"Scan with the device camera to open the certificate page." = "用设备相机扫码打开证书页面。";
"在设备上打开或扫码此地址即可：iPhone/iPad 会下载可安装的描述文件，Android 会下载证书，鸿蒙会显示安装说明。鸿蒙下载后不能直接在文件管理里点开安装，请到「设置 → 隐私和安全 → 更多安全设置 → 加密和凭据 → 安装数字证书 → CA 证书」中选择文件安装。" = "在设备上打开或扫码此地址即可：iPhone/iPad 会下载可安装的描述文件，Android 会下载证书，鸿蒙会显示安装说明。鸿蒙下载后不能直接在文件管理里点开安装，请到「设置 → 隐私和安全 → 更多安全设置 → 加密和凭据 → 安装数字证书 → CA 证书」中选择文件安装。";
"Open or scan this address on the device: iPhone/iPad get an installable profile, Android downloads the certificate, and HarmonyOS shows the install steps. On HarmonyOS the downloaded file cannot be installed by tapping it in Files — use Settings → Privacy & security → More security settings → Encryption and credentials → Install a certificate → CA certificate." = "在设备上打开或扫码此地址即可：iPhone/iPad 会下载可安装的描述文件，Android 会下载证书，鸿蒙会显示安装说明。鸿蒙下载后不能直接在文件管理里点开安装，请到「设置 → 隐私和安全 → 更多安全设置 → 加密和凭据 → 安装数字证书 → CA 证书」中选择文件安装。";
"Open or scan this address on the device: iPhone/iPad get an installable profile, Android and HarmonyOS 4.x download the certificate (the browser may offer to install it), and HarmonyOS NEXT shows the install steps. If tapping the file does nothing, install it from Settings → Privacy & security → More security settings → Encryption and credentials → Install a certificate → CA certificate." = "在设备上打开或扫码此地址即可：iPhone/iPad 下载可安装的描述文件；Android 与鸿蒙 4.x 会下载证书（部分浏览器会直接提示安装）；鸿蒙 NEXT 会显示安装说明。如果点开文件没有反应，请到「设置 → 隐私和安全 → 更多安全设置 → 加密和凭据 → 安装数字证书 → CA 证书」中选择该文件安装。";
"Open or scan this address on the device: iPhone/iPad get an installable profile, Android downloads the certificate, and HarmonyOS shows the exact install steps and download buttons. On HarmonyOS the downloaded file cannot be installed by tapping it in Files — follow the page and install it from Settings." = "在设备上打开或扫码此地址即可：iPhone/iPad 下载可安装的描述文件；Android 下载证书；鸿蒙会显示安装步骤和下载按钮（鸿蒙下载后不能直接在文件管理点开安装，请按页面提示到系统设置中安装）。";

